## Integrations

Step-by-step guides for connecting the tools a team already uses to Metabase. Each guide compares the connection routes — the MCP route for AI-assisted, conversational analysis and a warehouse-sync pipeline for durable, governed dashboards — and documents the shared data model, useful metrics, example SQL, and common mistakes.

- [Integrations catalog](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/): browsable directory of all integration guides, filterable by category.

### Issue tracking and software engineering

- [Issue tracking analytics in Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/issue-tracking): the shared data model (issues, projects, cycles/sprints, statuses, labels, history) and the DORA-style metrics and dashboards it powers across issue trackers.
- [Linear + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/linear): analyze issues, cycles, and project health; cycle time, throughput, and delivery health.
- [Jira + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/jira): track sprints, issues, and workflow status; sprint delivery and lead/cycle time.
- [GitHub + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/github): analyze pull requests, issues, and deployments; DORA metrics and engineering throughput.
- [GitLab + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/gitlab): analyze merge requests, issues, and pipelines; DORA metrics and delivery health.
- [Software delivery analytics in Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/analytics/software-delivery): how issue trackers, source control, CI/CD, and feature-flag tools combine into flow, throughput, and quality metrics.
- [Bitbucket + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/bitbucket): PR cycle time, review latency, merge frequency, and Pipelines health from Bitbucket Cloud.
- [Azure DevOps + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/azure-devops): work-item flow, pipeline health, PR reviews, and DORA metrics from Boards, Repos, and Pipelines.
- [Jenkins + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/jenkins): build success rate, pipeline duration, flaky tests, and agent utilization from Jenkins builds.
- [CircleCI + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/circleci): workflow success rate, duration percentiles, flaky tests, and credit usage from CircleCI.
- [Buildkite + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/buildkite): build pass rate, duration trends, test flakiness, and agent fleet utilization from Buildkite.
- [Shortcut + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/shortcut): story cycle time, iteration velocity, carryover, and bug flow from Shortcut.
- [LaunchDarkly + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/launchdarkly): flag rollouts, stale-flag debt, change activity, and experiment outcomes from LaunchDarkly.
- [Statsig + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/statsig): experiment velocity, gate rollouts, exposure volume, and metric lifts from Statsig.

### Collaboration and work management

- [Work management analytics in Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/analytics/work-management-analytics): shared work-item, content, and collaboration models for completion, flow, freshness, coverage, activity, response time, workload, and project health.
- [Collaboration & work management integrations](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/collaboration): how to connect 20+ work-management, communication, knowledge, design, and content tools to Metabase.
- [Notion + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/notion): project databases, task status, owners, due dates, and docs coverage from Notion.
- [Asana + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/asana): task completion, portfolio health, overdue work, workload, and project status from Asana.
- [ClickUp + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/clickup): list throughput, status aging, workload, overdue work, and goal progress from ClickUp.
- [Slack + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/slack): channel activity, threads, escalations, incident coordination, and collaboration load from Slack.
- [Trello + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/trello): board throughput, overdue cards, checklist progress, labels, and member workload from Trello.
- [monday.com + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/monday): board health, item completion, timeline risk, workload, and updates from monday.com.
- [Airtable + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/airtable): record workflows, overdue work, ownership, automation health, and base activity from Airtable.
- [Confluence + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/confluence): knowledge-base freshness, coverage, ownership, and page activity by Confluence space.
- [Wrike + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/wrike): task, portfolio, approval, capacity, and time-tracking dashboards from Wrike.
- [Miro + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/miro): board activity, ownership, workshop participation, comments, and stale workspaces from Miro.
- [Microsoft Teams + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/microsoft-teams): team and channel activity, response time, participation, and inactive spaces from Teams.
- [Figma + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/figma): design-file freshness, component coverage, comments, ownership, and library adoption from Figma.
- [Teamwork.com + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/teamwork): client project health, milestones, utilization, budgets, and workload from Teamwork.com.
- [Fibery + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/fibery): custom database workflows, entity throughput, activity, ownership, and stale work from Fibery.
- [Coda + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/coda): table workflows, doc freshness, ownership, row throughput, and workspace activity from Coda.
- [SharePoint + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/sharepoint): content freshness, ownership, site activity, sharing risk, and knowledge coverage from SharePoint.
- [Dropbox + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/dropbox): file activity, stale content, storage growth, external sharing, and ownership from Dropbox.
- [Box + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/box): content activity, freshness, collaboration coverage, sharing risk, and storage growth from Box.
- [Excel + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/excel): workbook freshness, table ownership, refresh status, operational rows, and migration candidates from Excel.

