### Sales and CRM

- [Sales analytics in Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/analytics/sales-analytics): the pillar overview — CRM data sources, the shared pipeline data model (deals, stages, stage-change history, activities), and the sales metrics and dashboards it powers.
- [Sales & CRM integrations](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/sales-crm): the shared data model across CRMs and how to connect HubSpot, Salesforce, Pipedrive, Attio, and Close to Metabase.
- [HubSpot + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/hubspot): pipeline, win rate, sales cycle, and forecasting from HubSpot deals, stages, and activities.
- [Salesforce + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/salesforce): model opportunities, stages, and OpportunityFieldHistory for pipeline, forecast, and win-rate dashboards.
- [Pipedrive + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/pipedrive): analyze deals, stages, and deal flow for pipeline, conversion, and sales-cycle dashboards.
- [Attio + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/attio): turn Attio records, deals, and lists into pipeline, conversion, and relationship dashboards.
- [Close + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/close): report on leads, opportunities, and outreach — pipeline, win rate, and activity from Close.
- [Zoho CRM + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/zoho-crm): model deals, stages, and activities from Zoho CRM into pipeline, win-rate, and conversion dashboards.
- [Microsoft Dynamics 365 Sales + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/dynamics-365-sales): turn Dataverse opportunities, stages, and activities into pipeline, forecast, and win-rate dashboards.
- [Twenty + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/twenty): query the open-source CRM directly from PostgreSQL — pipeline, conversion, and sales-cycle dashboards.
- [Affinity + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/affinity): turn Affinity persons, organizations, opportunities, and relationship data into deal-flow, pipeline, and sourcing dashboards.
- [SugarCRM + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/sugarcrm): model opportunities, accounts, and audit history from SugarCRM into pipeline, forecast, and win-rate dashboards.
- [Insightly + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/insightly): analyze opportunities, pipeline stages, and leads from Insightly for pipeline, win-rate, and conversion dashboards.
- [Breakcold + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/breakcold): report on deals, contacts, and activities from Breakcold — pipeline, win rate, and reply-rate dashboards.
- [Overloop + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/overloop): analyze deals, campaigns, and prospects from Overloop for pipeline, reply-rate, and deliverability dashboards.
- [CentralStationCRM + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/centralstationcrm): turn deals, people, and to-dos from CentralStationCRM into pipeline, win-rate, and activity dashboards.
- [Apollo + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/apollo): analyze sequences, email events, and meetings from Apollo — reply rate, meetings booked, and enrichment coverage.
- [Clay + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/clay): measure enrichment coverage, provider hit rate, and credits per usable contact from Clay.
- [Findymail + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/findymail): track match rate, valid-email share, and credits per usable contact from Findymail.
- [Tomba + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/tomba): measure email match rate, deliverable share, and credits per usable contact from Tomba.
- [Outreach + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/outreach): analyze sequences, mailings, and meetings from Outreach — reply rate, meetings booked, and funnel conversion.
- [Mixmax + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/mixmax): report on Gmail sales engagement — sequences, opens, replies, and meetings booked from Mixmax.
- [Gong + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/gong): turn Gong conversation data into call coverage, conversation quality, and deal-engagement dashboards.
- [Salesloft + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/salesloft): analyze Salesloft (and Clari) cadences and engagement — reply rate, meetings booked, and forecast accuracy.

