- [Productboard + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/productboard): feedback notes, feature pipelines, and insights-to-roadmap conversion from Productboard.
- [Aha! + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/aha): idea pipelines, vote velocity, and time from idea to release from Aha! Roadmaps.
- [Canny + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/canny): feature request pipeline, vote velocity, and close-the-loop dashboards from Canny posts and votes.
- [Featurebase + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/featurebase): feature requests, upvote velocity, and changelog cadence from Featurebase.
- [Typeform + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/typeform): survey responses, completion rates, and question drop-off from Typeform.
- [SurveyMonkey + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/surveymonkey): response rates, NPS and CSAT trends, and channel performance from SurveyMonkey.
- [Qualtrics + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/qualtrics): NPS programs, survey performance, and segment analysis from Qualtrics response exports.
- [Tally + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/tally): form submissions, completion rates, and feedback themes from Tally forms.
- [Fullstory + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/fullstory): rage clicks, frustration signals, and defined-event adoption from Fullstory Anywhere warehouse sync.
- [LogRocket + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/logrocket): session frustration, frontend errors, and release quality from LogRocket Streaming Data Export.
- [Contentsquare + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/contentsquare): journeys, frustration scores, and Heap behavioral data from Contentsquare (covers Hotjar and Heap).

### AI & LLM analytics

- [LLM analytics in Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/analytics/llm-analytics): shared request-rollup, trace, eval, and user models for token usage, cost, latency, error rates, cache savings, and eval quality.
- [AI & LLM analytics integrations](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/llm-observability): how to connect LLM tracing, cost, and eval tools to Metabase — including direct ClickHouse/Postgres routes for self-hosted deployments.
- [Langfuse + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/langfuse): LLM cost, token usage, latency, and eval quality from Langfuse traces and rollups.
- [LangSmith + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/langsmith): eval pass rates, score trends, regressions, and experiment costs from LangSmith.
- [Helicone + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/helicone): LLM spend, cost per user, cache savings, and latency from Helicone request logs.
- [Braintrust + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/braintrust): eval experiments, score regressions, and model comparisons from Braintrust.
- [Arize Phoenix + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/arize-phoenix): trace latency, token usage, errors, and eval scores from Arize Phoenix.
- [W&B Weave + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/wandb-weave): Weave traces, evaluation scores, and LLM usage alongside W&B training runs.
- [OpenRouter + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/openrouter): spend, token usage, and model mix across providers from OpenRouter activity data.

### Creator platforms

- [Creator analytics in Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/analytics/creator-analytics): shared order, enrollment, progress, member, and payout models for course revenue, completion, membership MRR, and net earnings after platform fees.
- [Creator platform integrations](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/creator-platforms): how Kajabi, Thinkific, Teachable, Gumroad, and Patreon connect to Metabase — and why scheduled API pulls, not connectors, are the normal route in this category.
- [Kajabi + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/kajabi): course revenue, refunds, and payout reconciliation from the Kajabi Public API — the official MCP server excludes analytics and payments.
- [Thinkific + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/thinkific): course revenue, enrollments, completion, and coupons; the only tool in the group with an official Fivetran connector.
- [Teachable + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/teachable): net revenue after affiliate and author fees, refund timing, and chargeback exposure from Teachable transactions.
- [Gumroad + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/gumroad): digital product sales, launch-week revenue, UTM attribution, and membership churn from the free, ungated Gumroad API.
- [Patreon + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/patreon): patron counts, cadence-normalized membership MRR, churn, and cohort retention from daily member snapshots.

### Shipping and logistics

- [Shipping & logistics integrations](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/shipping-logistics): how Shippo and ShipStation connect to Metabase — label cost, carrier mix, and delivery performance joined to the orders they belong to.
- [Shippo + Metabase](https://www.metabase.com/integrations/shippo): label spend, shipping cost per order, cost by zone and weight band, and on-time delivery from Shippo transactions.
